{
  "an4.195:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.195 ",
  "an4.195:0.2": "20. Mahāvagga ",
  "an4.195:0.3": "Vappasutta ",
  "an4.195:1.1": "Ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sakkesu viharati kapilavatthusmiṁ nigrodhārāme. ",
  "an4.195:1.2": "Atha kho vappo sakko nigaṇṭhasāvako yenāyasmā mahāmoggallāno tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā āyasmantaṁ mahāmoggallānaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinnaṁ kho vappaṁ sakkaṁ nigaṇṭhasāvakaṁ āyasmā mahāmoggallāno etadavoca: ",
  "an4.195:2.1": "“Idhassa, vappa, kāyena saṁvuto vācāya saṁvuto manasā saṁvuto avijjāvirāgā vijjuppādā. ",
  "an4.195:2.2": "Passasi no tvaṁ, vappa, taṁ ṭhānaṁ yatonidānaṁ purisaṁ dukkhavedaniyā āsavā assaveyyuṁ abhisamparāyan”ti? ",
  "an4.195:2.3": "“Passāmahaṁ, bhante, taṁ ṭhānaṁ. ",
  "an4.195:2.4": "Idhassa, bhante, pubbe pāpakammaṁ kataṁ avipakkavipākaṁ. ",
  "an4.195:2.5": "Tatonidānaṁ purisaṁ dukkhavedaniyā āsavā assaveyyuṁ abhisamparāyan”ti. ",
  "an4.195:2.6": "Ayañceva kho pana āyasmato mahāmoggallānassa vappena sakkena nigaṇṭhasāvakena saddhiṁ antarākathā vippakatā hoti. ",
  "an4.195:3.1": "Atha kho bhagavā sāyanhasamayaṁ paṭisallānā vuṭṭhito yena upaṭṭhānasālā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā paññatte āsane nisīdi. Nisajja kho bhagavā āyasmantaṁ mahāmoggallānaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "an4.195:4.1": "“Kāya nuttha, moggallāna, etarahi kathāya sannisinnā; kā ca pana vo antarāka